                    "message": "Created sample test script and made sure there is no code break for the impacted keywords\n\n```\n*** Settings ***\nResource         ../lib/resource.robot\nResource         ../lib/bmc_redfish_resource.robot\nResource         ../lib/common_utils.robot\nSuite Setup      Redfish.Login\nSuite Teardown   Redfish.Logout\n\n*** Test Cases ***\nTest Directive Fix\n\n    Check OS\n    Set BMC Reset Reference Time\n\n    Start SOL Console Logging   ${EXECDIR}/esol.log\n    Stop SOL Console Logging\n\n    Check For Core Dumps\n    ${boot_count}=   Get BMC Boot Count\n    Log To Console  ${boot_count}\n\n    Check For Regex In Journald   bmc\n```"
